      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/followlastma/status/1936489025314902453",
      "text": "[7:12PM] #Ikorodu #TrafficUpdate \n\nBusy traffic movement from Ragolis inward Benson, and towards Ikorodu Interchange.\nGood traffic flow from the Interchange inward Aleje.\nGood traffic conditions from Aleje connecting to Sabo.\nSlightly busy traffic from Sabo inward Ilepo Oba, primarily due to increased rider and pedestrian activities.\nEncouraging traffic movement beyond Ilepo Oba, connecting to LASTMA Yard, Jubilee, Okegbegun, and up to First Gate, although approaching First Gate is slightly busy due to traffic alternation and pedestrian activities.\nGood traffic flow inward Odogunyan, as well as on the return journey.\nSmooth traffic movement from Ikorodu Interchange inward along the stretch of Oba Ayangburen Road to Ojobo, with a similar smooth return journey.\nUnimpeded traffic flow from Ojobo connecting Ladega, Itumoja, Itunmeko, down to Ota Ona.\nGood traffic conditions along the entire stretch of Ota Ona, connecting to Grammar School, Erunwen, Radio, and towards Itamaga, with a similarly smooth return journey.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
