      "text": "[8PM] #OkeOdoAbuleEgba #TrafficUpdate \n\nGood traffic conditions from Ilepo, with movement towards Super being notably good.\nSmooth traffic flow from Abule Egba Under Bridge, Oja Oba, connecting Charity Intersection, with good traffic movement observed in both inward and outward directions.\nUnimpeded traffic movement by the bridge towards Mobil.\nGood traffic flow from Awori to Ahammadiya, Ajala, and further to Ijaye, with good vehicular movement.\nGood traffic conditions from Casso, Kola, and Moshalashi, connecting to Ajegunle.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
