      "text": "[8:30PM] #Alausa_Ikeja #TrafficUpdate \n\nBusy vehicular movement on Obafemi Awolowo Way from Balogun, approaching Allen Intersection, and onward Radio Junction. \nThis congestion is attributed to a containerized trailer that has broken down, blocking the entire road from Alausa Bus Stop to Ojota on Kudirat Abiola Way.\nEfforts are underway, with officers on ground to mitigate the impact of the breakdown and ensure traffic flow.\nAppreciable traffic movement is observed on other corridors within Alausa and Ikeja, which are currently unaffected by the breakdown.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
