      "text": "[8:43PM] #OjoduBerger #TrafficUpdate \n\nGood traffic movement in and out on the Lagos-Ibadan Expressway.\nFast-moving traffic on the stretch of Isheri Olowora, River Valley, VIS, Omole Gate, down to Omole Junction.\nImproved traffic flow observed towards Excellence, Yaya Abaton, Kayode, Caterpillar, Odo Eran, and Wempco, with a smooth return journey from Wempco to Odo Eran and Caterpillar.\nEncouraging traffic movement from Wempco inw Lateef Jakande, connecting to Omole Junction, Omole Gate, VIS, River Valley, and further to Isheri Olowora, with fast-moving traffic.\n\nOfficers are on ground, effectively managing the traffic situation.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
